config XIAOMI_MILLET_OEM_CGROUP
	tristate "Xiaomi Millet freezer cgroup policy"
	depends on CGROUP_FREEZER
	help
	  Install Xiaomi's legacy freezer cgroup migration policy. Cross-task
	  moves are allowed only for Android system UID 1000 or callers with
	  CAP_SYS_ADMIN in the initial user namespace. Self-migration remains
	  allowed.
